<!-- SEO Content -->
<section class="py-12 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Voice recording pricing - what affects the price?</h2>
    <p>Voice recording prices depend on several factors: the type of production, text length, and the chosen voice artist. Short <a href="/en/voiceover-services/phone-announcements/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">phone announcements</a> are priced differently than elaborate film narrations or audiobooks. Voice artists from the "Famous and Loved" category - recognisable voices known from radio and television - have higher rates, which results from their experience and voice recognition.</p>
    <p>The prices listed in the pricing table are minimum net rates in EUR. An exact quote can be obtained directly on the selected voice artist's profile in our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">voice bank</a> - just paste the text to be recorded, and the system will automatically calculate the price. You can also use the <a href="/en/#kreator" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">Voice Content Creator</a>, which will help prepare a professional script and immediately proceed to pricing.</p>
    <p>The voice recording price includes recording in a professional studio, audio processing, and delivery of a ready audio file in the selected format (WAV, MP3). In the case of radio and television commercials, the rate also includes a broadcast licence for a period of up to 12 months.</p>
    <p>Standard delivery time is 24-72 working hours. For urgent projects, we offer <a href="/en/express-recording/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">express recordings</a> with delivery even on the day of order. Regular clients receive custom pricing terms - <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">contact us</a> to discuss collaboration details.</p>
  </div>
</section>

